PyKDDockWidgetsQt6
Unofficial Python bindings package for KDDockWidgets

This directory packages Python bindings for the upstream KDDockWidgets project.
It includes vendored upstream source code from KDDockWidgets together with local build, packaging,
and stub-generation glue used by the vsview project.

Upstream KDDockWidgets is Copyright Klaralvdalens Datakonsult AB (KDAB)
and remains licensed under KDAB's terms, including:

- GNU General Public License v2.0 only
- GNU General Public License v3.0 only
- commercial licensing from KDAB

See the vendored upstream source tree for the authoritative license texts, including:

- submodules/KDDockWidgets/LICENSE.GPL.txt
- submodules/KDDockWidgets/LICENSES/

Contact KDAB at <info@kdab.com> for commercial licensing information regarding KDDockWidgets itself.

Unless stated otherwise in a specific file header, the local packaging code in
this directory is provided for the vsview project on an as-is basis, without
warranty. It does not relicense, replace, or narrow the licensing that applies
to the vendored upstream KDDockWidgets sources.
